{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026XQeJWNuDhZ1793676878.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>行政長官李家超前往北京和上海訪問。</p><p></p><p>李家超抵達機場，出發前往北京，將與北京市官員會面。他明天出席京港洽談會開幕式和致辭。今屆洽談會主題是「揚帆十五五、京港共未來」。</p><p></p><p>之後李家超會轉往上海，出席周四舉行的第九屆進博會暨虹橋國際經濟論壇開幕式，參觀香港展區和香港企業展位，並於虹橋國際經濟論壇香港分論壇致辭，他亦會與上海市官員會面。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T05:42:38.553810+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":164,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T03:29:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T22:58:17.740409+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T05:38:54.239515+00:00","content_hash":"0d625779c5d4e497ae6a823bd211aef47307a577c56db3b30428508349deb634","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T05:42:38.553810+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}